# SIMULATION (model curve), NOT an observation. Asthana et al. (2025), MNRAS 542, 2968 (arXiv:2409.15453), Fig. 3 panel C (blue solid): total ionizing emissivity (galaxies + AGN), per comoving Mpc^3 (no h).
#   The run emits in 40-Myr snapshot steps (a staircase between z = 5 and 10).
#   "QSO-only" run: no stellar sources; AGN in 10% of the haloes (>= 1e9 Msun/h; 10 Myr lifetime, f_esc = 1,
#   f_nu ~ nu^-1.7) from z = 17.
#   ATON-HE radiative transfer (H and He) post-processing the Sherwood-Relics 160 cMpc/h, 2x2048^3 hydro run; the total emissivity
#   is an INPUT, tuned by hand to the mean Lya transmission of Bosman et al. (2022; XQR-30) at 5 < z < 6.2; h = 0.678.
#   Read from the published vector figure (native path vertices, axes calibrated on the tick marks);
#   curve: Asthana2025_2409.15453/extracted/Asthana2025_Fig3_emissivity_QSO-only.csv in the papers folder.
# z  Ndot[1e50 s^-1 cMpc^-3]
